# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# .NET  (OfferlalFashion.Api)
#
# Scoped to the API project, not bare (e.g. "[Dd]ebug/" unscoped also
# matched OfferlalMobile/android/app/src/debug/ — a real Android source
# set, not build output - which silently swallowed its AndroidManifest.xml
# and network_security_config.xml as "ignored" rather than "untracked".
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
OfferlalFashion.Api/**/[Bb]in/
OfferlalFashion.Api/**/[Oo]bj/
OfferlalFashion.Api/**/[Dd]ebug/
OfferlalFashion.Api/**/[Rr]elease/
OfferlalFashion.Api/**/x64/
OfferlalFashion.Api/**/x86/
OfferlalFashion.Api/**/[Aa][Rr][Mm]/
OfferlalFashion.Api/**/[Aa][Rr][Mm]64/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.userprefs
.vs/
artifacts/
project.lock.json
project.fragment.lock.json
*.nupkg
*.snupkg

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Secrets — never commit real credentials
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# appsettings.json is committed (local dev connection string only, no secrets).
# Real credentials (Razorpay keys, SMTP, JWT signing key, prod connection string)
# must go in User Secrets / environment variables — never in a committed file.
appsettings.Production.json
appsettings.Staging.json
appsettings.*.Local.json
*.pfx
*.p12
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
secrets.json

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Database — schema/seed SQL IS committed; local backups are not
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.bak
*.mdf
*.ldf
*.ndf

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Editors / OS
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# VS Code: keep shared settings, ignore personal ones
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/tasks.json

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Logs / temp
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
logs/
*.log
tmp/
temp/

# Ionic/Capacitor mobile app
OfferlalMobile/www/
OfferlalMobile/ios/

# Local build tooling (portable JDK / Android SDK, not for version control)
tools/

# Uploaded media lives on disk, not in the repo — content-addressed and
# reproducible from the media library.
OfferlalFashion.Api/wwwroot/media/
